                  <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Paris, 6e Arr.</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Jardin du Luxembourg</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Tarihi ağaçlar altında zarif Toy Poodle yürüyüş rotaları, pet dostu açık hava bistroları ve su çeşmeleri.</p>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-gray-200/60 dark:border-[#262626]">
                  <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-500 font-bold">🐾 6 Poodle aktif</span>
                  <button type="button" onclick="showToast('Paris konumu açıldı');" class="text-xs text-[#0095f6] font-bold hover:underline">Haritada Gör →</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="loc-card p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50/70 dark:bg-[#181818] flex flex-col gap-2" data-city="newyork">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 font-bold">🇺🇸 Central Dog Meadow</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">New York, Manhattan</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Central Park Sheep Meadow</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">New York Toy Poodle Kulübü'nün hafta sonu buluşma noktası. Geniş çim alanlar ve sosyal frisbee etkinlikleri.</p>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-gray-200/60 dark:border-[#262626]">
                  <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-500 font-bold">🐾 12 Poodle aktif</span>
                  <button type="button" onclick="showToast('New York konumu açıldı');" class="text-xs text-[#0095f6] font-bold hover:underline">Haritada Gör →</button>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- TAB 8: DİL SEÇİMİ -->
          <div id="info-panel-language" class="info-panel hidden flex flex-col gap-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 bg-sky-500/10 text-[#0095f6] font-bold text-xs rounded-full w-fit">
                <span>🌐</span> 9 Desteklenen Dil
              </span>
              <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Dil Seçimi & Internationalization</h2>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                YourPoodle tüm dünyadaki Toy Poodle topluluğuna ana dilinde hizmet verir. Tercih ettiğiniz dili seçin; tüm arayüz anında güncellensin.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('en'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇺🇸</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">English</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">EN</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('ja'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇯🇵</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">日本語</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">JA</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('es'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇪🇸</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">Español</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">ES</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('fr'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇫🇷</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">Français</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">FR</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('de'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇩🇪</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">Deutsch</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">DE</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('pt'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇧🇷</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">Português</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">PT</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('ko'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇰🇷</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">한국어</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">KO</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('zh-CN'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇨🇳</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">简体中文</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">ZH</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="ypI18n.selectLanguage('tr'); closeInfoModal();" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#262626] bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-[#181818] dark:hover:bg-[#222] transition flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer border-emerald-500/40">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🇹🇷</span><span class="font-bold text-sm">Türkçe</span></span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">TR</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
